A glossy blue icon in the [[frutiger-aero|Frutiger Aero]] style, with a soft gradient fill and a thick rounded outline. OpenDB uses it on the `{{orphan}}`, `{{in use}}` and `{{merge}}` templates, and as the small link to each template's page. A smaller copy is used on the site itself.
